          "overview": "## istfin (Remote)\n\nistfin's official hosted MCP server for licensed Borsa Istanbul (BIST) market data. It gives AI assistants live or 15-minute delayed prices, OHLCV bars from 1 minute to monthly, financial statements, valuation ratios, KAP disclosures, indices and sectors for 600+ Turkish stocks. Assistants can also run indicator-based strategy backtests and track the user's portfolio. Users sign in with their istfin account over OAuth; the server never places orders.",
